Well, the Legendary Trident is very powerful. Yaten made Arteres steal it from Celina's chambers and used it to revive Yagditha's defeated troops. Unsatisfied, he tried to take it from her and was nearly killed. But Midranda saved him, killing Yaten, and bewitched him, seizing the throne.
Meanwhile, the Pristonians defeated Leusen again and faced Arteres and Octulhus. Octulhus was defeated and, with Zarad's magic shell, my song awakened Arteres.

Yagditha broke free and allied with Zarad to defeat Midranda, but the attack failed. Yagditha used me to take Zarad prisoner. We have to save him.
Come on, go look for clues of my Zarad!!

Collect the Rough Scale by hunting Dey or Koon and come back here.
